<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Cadac changes name to Wellington Drive.</title>
<headline>NZ's Cadac changes name to Wellington Drive.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sharemart-listed Cadac Ltd has changed its name to Wellington Drive Technologies, director Ray Thomson said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The company, which has an electric motor patent, is 25 percent owned by Strathmore Group.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
